\nGround&nbsp;Delay&nbsp;(16:48&nbsp;to&nbsp;16:55):&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;-&nbsp;0/0<br />\r\nMinimum&nbsp;28&nbsp;overs&nbsp;remaining<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;Innings</strong><br />\r\n9.6&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;37&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;2&nbsp;extras<br />\r\n11.5&nbsp;Ball&nbsp;Change&nbsp;(17:40&nbsp;to&nbsp;17:41):&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;-&nbsp;59/2&nbsp;in&nbsp;11.5&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;Raj&nbsp;Hothi&nbsp;10&nbsp;(16),&nbsp;Ronnie&nbsp;Jackson&nbsp;5&nbsp;(5)<br />\r\n12.1&nbsp;Start&nbsp;of&nbsp;Last&nbsp;Hour&nbsp;(17:41):&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;-&nbsp;59/2&nbsp;after&nbsp;12.0&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;Raj&nbsp;Hothi&nbsp;10&nbsp;(16),&nbsp;Ronnie&nbsp;Jackson&nbsp;5&nbsp;(6),&nbsp;2&nbsp;extras,&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;17&nbsp;overs&nbsp;remaining<br />\r\n20.4&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;100&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;20.4&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;75&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;4&nbsp;extras<br />\r\nRain&nbsp;(18:21&nbsp;to&nbsp;18:31):&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;-&nbsp;123/4&nbsp;in&nbsp;22.5&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;Jon&nbsp;O&#39;Neill&nbsp;45&nbsp;(27),&nbsp;Sid&nbsp;Patel&nbsp;8&nbsp;(20)<br />\r\nGround&nbsp;Delay&nbsp;(18:31&nbsp;to&nbsp;18:53*):&nbsp;Rainham&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;Essex&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;-&nbsp;123/4&nbsp;in&nbsp;22.5&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;Jon&nbsp;O&#39;Neill&nbsp;45&nbsp;(27),&nbsp;Sid&nbsp;Patel&nbsp;8&nbsp;(20)<br />\r\n23.3&nbsp;Jon&nbsp;O&#39;Neill:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;30&nbsp;balls,&nbsp;41&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;(4x4,&nbsp;2x6)<br />\r\n23.6&nbsp;5th&nbsp;Wicket:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;40&nbsp;balls,&nbsp;29&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;Jon&nbsp;O&#39;Neill&nbsp;39&nbsp;(18),&nbsp;Sid&nbsp;Patel&nbsp;13&nbsp;(22),&nbsp;1&nbsp;extra</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Rainham&nbsp;were&nbsp;ready&nbsp;to&nbsp;restart